{"overview":"راکون‌های تپه‌های تاما به دلیل توسعه سریع خانه‌ها و مراکز خرید، از خانه‌هایشان رانده می‌شوند. با سختی یافتن غذا و پناه، تصمیم می‌گیرند با هم متحد شوند و مقابله کنند. راکون‌ها هنر قدیمی تغییر شکل را تمرین و به‌کمال می‌رسانند تا حتی بتوانند در موقعیت‌های خنده‌دار به‌صورت انسان ظاهر شوند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The Raccoons of the Tama Hills are being forced from their homes by the rapid development of houses and shopping malls. As it becomes harder to find food and shelter, they decide to band together and fight back. The Raccoons practice and perfect the ancient art of transformation until they are even able to appear as humans in hilarious circumstances.","tagline_en":"A fantastic tale of survival.","runtime":119,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["ایسائو تاکاهاتا"],"crew_en":["Isao Takahata"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"野々村真","role":"Shoukichi (voice)","photo":"/pU34XbpeNWJrN9qqLKHRAogMIf5.jpg","en":"Makoto Nonomura"},{"name":"清川虹子","role":"Old Fireball / Oroku (voice)","photo":"/4vGxJRwHHCwCkXmf6flTXYBffGI.jpg","en":"Nijiko Kiyokawa"},{"name":"泉谷しげる","role":"Gonta (voice)","photo":"/Ao2ARY8WJcp12wlu9KeqzfnMuDf.jpg","en":"Shigeru Izumiya"},{"name":"三木のり平","role":"Seizaemon (voice)","photo":"/984iWskRHBbOYIZHxJBXuwk0mDV.jpg","en":"Norihei Miki"},{"name":"石田ゆり子","role":"Kiyo (voice)","photo":"/cADoBCi603Chz2IaxcwWT2mNwCf.jpg","en":"Yuriko Ishida"},{"name":"林原めぐみ","role":"Sasuke (voice)","photo":"/3Alm4pmBIxpeeh0Sdippxdbkpne.jpg","en":"Megumi Hayashibara"},{"name":"市原由美","role":"Koharu (voice)","photo":"/B5geabQ1AjHxEBhrAKORD5zBSl.jpg","en":"Yumi Ichihara"},{"name":"神谷明","role":"Tamasaburo (voice)","photo":"/tJRMwbWFObv03KhATALs0Xbbgq7.jpg","en":"Akira Kamiya"},{"name":"村田雄浩","role":"Bunta (voice)","photo":"/he1V9AFAS0rKIy94WnpKN8YxHWW.jpg","en":"Takehiro Murata"},{"name":"芦屋雁之助","role":"Inugami Gyobu (voice)","photo":"/dEWuwmzt2l3aGjhnAQbDDuSdlQs.jpg","en":"Gannosuke Ashiya"},{"name":"柳家小さん","role":"Tsurukame (voice)",